<title>USA: Parker Hannifin Corp Q3 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>Parker Hannifin Corp Q3 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.05		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			 77,964		   69,128</p>
<p> Revs		   1,047,100		  931,356</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,465		   74,189</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.44		    $2.36</p>
<p> Net			181,633		  174,899</p>
<p> Revs		   2,976,015		2,594,786</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,384		   74,139</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: About three-fourths of 12.4 percent sales increase for Q3 1997 due to acquisitions completed within past 12 months.</p>
<p>First Call Q3 1997 estimate was $0.97 per share.</p>
</text>
